'''Misdreavus''' (Japanese: '''ムウマ''' ''Muma'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

